        <mxCell id="n19" value="&lt;b&gt;screenFlow · iteration&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;one step: “the loop”&lt;br&gt;THE SET (train rows) · THE DESCRIPTION (the wording, in draft) · ITERATIONS&lt;br&gt;enter save &amp;amp; run · R run again · f the failures · tab quadrants" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=7;container=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=light-dark(#eff6ff,#0d1a2b);strokeColor=light-dark(#2563eb,#6ea8ff);strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
