        <mxCell id="n22" value="&lt;b&gt;screenQuality · initialization&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;qSetup — the set the loop is measured on&lt;br&gt;the loop band: what keeps it closed, and the one errand that opens it&lt;br&gt;case list | case pane: prompt, expected output, fixtures, assertions&lt;br&gt;e assertions · n new case · S evals.json · r run the case · v outputs · f review" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;arcSize=7;container=0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=12;spacingLeft=12;spacingRight=12;fontSize=12;fillColor=light-dark(#f5f3ff,#1a1230);strokeColor=light-dark(#7c3aed,#b39bff);strokeWidth=2;" vertex="1" parent="1">
