        <mxCell id="flownote" value="the loop, in one sentence: R runs the train set, f reads what failed, the description is revised in place, R again — at five measured wordings the ranking opens, v measures them on the validation set, and a writes the winner into SKILL.md. The output lane is the same shape: run, read the failures, revise, rerun." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=light-dark(#475569,#94a3b8);" vertex="1" parent="1">
